<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's forex kerb market closed on holiday.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's forex kerb market closed on holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign exchange kerb market in Karachi was closed on Wednesday due to a national holiday to mark the 48th death anniversary of the country's founder Mohamamd Ali Jinnah.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
